    "○のマスに置けるよ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can play on the ○ squares"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "♠♥♦♣ ごとに A から K まで組札に積み上げたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build each of ♠♥♦♣ from A to K on the foundations to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "♠♥♦♣ ごとに A から K まで組札に積み上げたらクリアです。52枚すべて最初から見えています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build each of ♠♥♦♣ from A to K on the foundations to win. All 52 cards are face up from the start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ". "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」で新しく始めます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts a new game on %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を開いて新しく始めます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens %@ and starts a new game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「スピン」でホイールが回り、玉の真下で止まったポケットの数字が出目です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Press “Spin” to turn the wheel. The pocket the ball lands in is the result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ヒット」でもう 1 枚引き、「スタンド」でそこで止めます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Hit” to draw another card, “Stand” to stop there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「ヒット」でもう 1 枚引き、「スタンド」でそこで止めます。最初の 2 枚では、賭けを倍にして 1 枚だけ引く「ダブルダウン」と、同じ点数の 2 枚（10・J・Q・K は同じ 10 点）を 2 手に分ける「スプリット」も選べます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Hit” to draw a card, “Stand” to stop there. On your first 2 cards you can also “Double Down” (double your bet and draw just one card) or “Split” two cards of the same value (10, J, Q and K are all worth 10) into two hands."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびば" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
