          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your turn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの直前の1手を、CPU の応手ごと取り消します" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Takes back your last move along with the CPU's reply"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの直前の1手を、CPU の応手ごと取り消します。\n無料で使えるのは1回だけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Takes back your last move along with the CPU's reply.\nYou get one free undo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの負け" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You Lose"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたは白。サイコロは自動で振られ、出た目のぶんだけ駒を右下の自陣へ向けて進めます。動かす駒 → 行き先の順にタップ。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You play White. The dice roll automatically, and you move your checkers by the numbers rolled toward your home board at the bottom right. Tap a checker, then where it goes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは使えません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
