    "つぎは「%@」にしてみる？" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try %@ next?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ときどき落ちてくるアイテムをパドルで受けると、パドルが伸びたり球が増えたりします。壊せるブロックを全部消すと次のステージへ。盤の球をすべて落とすと 1 ミスで、3 回で終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Catch the items that sometimes fall to get a longer paddle or extra balls. Break every breakable block to reach the next stage. Losing all your balls costs a life, and the game ends after 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "とばし・ぎゃく・+2・いろがえ・いろがえ+4 の特殊札で流れを変えましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn the game around with the special cards: Skip, Reverse, +2, Color Change, and Color Change +4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どちらも出せなくなったら「めくる」で、両方の山札から1枚ずつ台札に置きます。CPU の速さは右上の「速さ」で選べます。あなたの側に制限時間はありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When neither side can play, tap “Flip” to put one card from each stock onto the piles. Set the CPU's speed with “Pace” at the top right. There's no time limit on your side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
