    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらおしまい。途中で閉じると記録は残りません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and the run is over. If you close the game midway, the run isn't recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらミス。何度でもステージの頭からやり直せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and it's a wipeout. You can restart the stage as many times as you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぶつかるか穴に落ちたらミス。何度でもステージの頭からやり直せます。青いチェックポイントより先で失敗した場合は、広告を見てそこから再開することもできます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crash or fall into a hole and it's a wipeout. You can restart the stage as many times as you like. If you fail past a blue checkpoint, you can watch an ad to restart from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの駒の動きや特別ルールは「くわしいルール」で見られます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
