          }
        }
      }
    },
    "入院か、荷物が出てくる位置（▼の列のいちばん上）が埋まったら終わりです。どちらも記録は残ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends if he's hospitalized or the spot where boxes appear (the top of the ▼ column) fills up. Your record is saved either way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出した札のぶん、山札から手札に補充されます。手札も山札も先に出し切ったほうの勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hand refills from your stock as you play. The first to play out both their hand and stock wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せない・出したくないときはパス。全員パスすると場が流れます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you can't or don't want to play, pass. When everyone passes, the table is cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札がなければ山から 1 枚引きます。引いた札が出せるなら、そのまま出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you can't play, draw a card. If the card you drew can be played, you can play it right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出た数をぜんぶ足そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add up all the numbers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切る牌をタップしよう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a tile to discard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "制限時間は60秒。しりとりが成立するたびに+10秒、成立しない札を選ぶと-5秒。「ん」で終わる読みを選ぶとその場で負けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You have 60 seconds. Each good link adds 10 seconds, and a card that doesn't link takes 5 seconds away. Pick a reading that ends in “n” and you lose on the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列か、左上のフリーセル、右上の組札をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap a column, a free cell (top left), or a foundation (top right)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列かフリーセル、組札をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap a column, a free cell, or a foundation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列か右上の組札をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap the column or the foundation (top right) to move it to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列をタップします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap the column to move it to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす札をタップして選び、置きたい列をタップします。置けるのは、ひとつ上の札より1つ小さい札（スートは問いません）か、空いた列です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap the column to move it to. A card can go on one that's one higher (any suit), or in an empty column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かす駒 → 行き先の順にタップ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a checker, then where it goes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かせなくなる前に 2048 のタイルを作れたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Make a 2048 tile before you run out of moves to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かせる手が無くなったら左上の山札をタップ。各列に 1 枚ずつ配ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Out of moves? Tap the stock at the top left to deal one card to each column."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "半透明の○が置けるマスです。タップして石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Faint ○ marks show where you can play. Tap one to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取れるのは、上に牌が乗っておらず、左右どちらかが空いている牌だけです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can only take a tile with nothing on top and an open left or right side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札と1つ違いの札を重ねよう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play a card one higher or lower than a pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台札は真ん中の2山。手札から、台札の数字と1つ違い（A と K もつながる）の札を、どちらかの台札に重ねます。順番はなく、CPU も同時に出してきます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The two piles in the middle are the play piles. Play a card from your hand that's one higher or lower than either pile (A and K connect). There are no turns: the CPU plays at the same time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右上の「難易度」で桁数・個数・速さをそれぞれ選べます。まずは 1 桁・5 個から。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use “Difficulty” at the top right to set the digits, how many numbers, and the speed. Start with 1 digit and 5 numbers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合計飛距離を伸ばそう。挑戦は1日3回で、打席に立った時点で1回減ります（0:00 に戻ります）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go for the longest total distance. You get 3 rounds a day; one is used as soon as you step up to bat (they reset at 0:00)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートで K から A まで 13 枚揃うと自動で取り除かれ、8 組取り除いたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A full same-suit run from K to A (13 cards) is removed automatically. Remove 8 to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じスートで K から A まで13枚揃うと自動で取り除かれます。8組すべて取り除いたらクリアです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A full same-suit run from K to A (13 cards) is removed automatically. Remove all 8 to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字どうしがぶつかると合体して 2 倍になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When two tiles with the same number collide, they merge into one with double the value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ数字を 4 枚以上まとめて出すと革命。カードの強さが逆になります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing 4 or more of the same number at once starts a Revolution, which flips the card ranking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ月を合わせる" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match cards of the same month"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ条件でもう一回" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play Again, Same Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ果物どうしが触れるとくっついて、1 つ大きい果物になります。いちばん大きいのはメロンです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When two of the same fruit touch, they merge into the next bigger fruit. The biggest is the melon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌 3 枚か連番 3 枚を 4 組と、同じ牌 2 枚を 1 組そろえたら和了です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Build 4 sets (3 of a kind or a 3-tile run) plus a pair to win."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ牌を 2 枚タップで消そう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap 2 matching tiles to clear them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じ絵柄の牌を 2 枚タップすると消えます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
