      }
    },
    "自己ベスト更新！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Personal Best!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花札こいこいの遊び方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to Play Hanafuda Koi-Koi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "花牌どうし・季節牌どうしは、絵柄がちがってもペアになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any two flower tiles make a pair, and so do any two season tiles, even if the pictures differ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物が出てくる位置（▼の列のいちばん上）が埋まったら終わりです。記録は得点として残ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends when the spot where boxes appear (the top of the ▼ column) fills up. Your score is saved as your record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物は 5 種類。重いものほど腰にきます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 5 kinds of boxes. The heavier they are, the more they hurt his back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物は 5 種類あります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There are 5 kinds of boxes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を 4 つそろえて消して、ラインより下まで片付けたらクリア。腰をいたわろう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match 4 boxes to clear them, and clear everything below the line to win. Go easy on his back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を 4 つそろえて消して、得点をのばそう。空の盤から始まり、埋まるまで続きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match 4 boxes to clear them and rack up points. You start with an empty board and play until it fills up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷物を置くほど少しずつ速くなります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boxes fall a little faster the more you place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "荷運びモードはラインより下まで片付けたらクリア。重い荷物をかかえるほど腰にきて、満タンで入院です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Moving Mode, clear everything below the line to win. Heavy boxes strain Ojisan's back, and a full gauge sends him to the hospital."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "記録をシェア" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
